#, fuzzy
msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr "¿Qué hay de nuevo?"

msgid "Continuous Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas continuas"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The most visible being a far improvement integration in the Dev UI."
msgstr "La más visible es la mejora de la integración en la interfaz de usuario."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Another notable one is the addition of `quarkus.test.type` which can be used to define which tests are run in continuous testing, `unit`, `quarkus-test` or `all`."
